     "title": "Five Misconceptions About Digitalization",
     "teaser": "Small businesses, especially, are hesitant to digitize their manufacturing processes, thereby missing out on efficiency gains. Preconceived notions are often the reason. It’s high time to dispel these misconceptions and highlight suitable solutions for small and medium-sized manufacturing operations.",
