      "Press Release",
      "Tool Management"
     ],
     "title": "How to Deal with the Tungsten Price Shock",
     "teaser": "There are two strategies to counter the extreme price increases for solid carbide tools: greater efficiency in tool usage and the highest precision in regrinding processes.",
